      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صاكّهُ</span></b>  [<i>He struck him,</i> or <i>it;</i> or <i>struck him,</i>
or <i>it, vehemently, with a broad thing,</i> or <i>with
